{"id":"nebesa","lemma":"небеса","pos":"noun","rank":1863,"glosses":["heavens, skies"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7a/LL-Q7737_%28rus%29-DomesticFrog-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%B1%D0%B5%D1%81%D0%B0.wav/LL-Q7737_%28rus%29-DomesticFrog-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%B1%D0%B5%D1%81%D0%B0.wav.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"небес"},"examples":[{"text":"Как мне попасть на небеса?","en":"How can I get to heaven?","words":[{"g":"how / like"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"to hit"},{"g":"on / at"},null]},{"text":"Спустись с небес на землю.","en":"Get real.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/748216","words":[{"g":"to descend, to go down","l":"спуститься"},{"g":"with / from"},null,{"g":"on / at"},null]},{"text":"Я думал, что умер и попал на небеса.","en":"I thought I'd died and gone to heaven.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"to die of natural causes","l":"умереть"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"to hit","l":"попасть"},{"g":"on / at"},null]},{"text":"Том считает себя подарком небес для женщин.","en":"Tom thinks he's God's gift to women.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to calculate","l":"считать"},{"g":"oneself"},null,null,{"g":"for"},null]},{"text":"Мой отец всегда говорил, что небеса помогают тем, кто сам себе помогает.","en":"My father always said that heaven helps those who help themselves.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"father"},{"g":"always"},{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"},{"g":"what / that"},null,{"g":"to help","l":"помогать"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"self, -self"},{"g":"myself","l":"себя"},{"g":"to help","l":"помогать"}]}]}